@IBKR adds support for new cryptocurrencies.

Brokerage firm Interactive Brokers has expanded its list of available digital assets by adding Solana, Cardano, XRP, and Dogecoin.   

Previously, platform clients already had access to Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, and Bitcoin Cash. https://t.co/c55rxYYaIU

@SECGov postpones decision on @Solana ETF.

The SEC has decided to focus on Polkadot, XRP and Dogecoin for now, putting the Solana ETF on hold.
